  Slug: hunting-catfolk
  DisplayName: Hunting Catfolk
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/hunting-catfolk.webp
  Description: You come from a long line of skilled hunters and trackers and have
    a particularly keen sense of smell. You gain imprecise scent with a range of
    30 feet. This means you can use your sense of smell to determine a creature's
    location. The GM will usually double the range if you're downwind from the creature
    or halve the range if you're upwind. In addition, you gain a +2 circumstance
    bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Track] a creature or object if
    you've smelled it before.
